              {
                "label": "Bloom Characteristics",
                "content": "Inflorescence is 6-12\" (15-30 cm) long with a single, waxy, long lasting flower. Flower is 4-6\" (10-15 cm) across, but can be small as 2\" (5 cm) across or as large as 7\" (17.8 cm)."
              },
